rom Akihabara's Cocoon. He works a rotation of day shift > night shift > post-shift rest > day off."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29365"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f704fc2a1c41fbf9c8c1e24fd94170c754076096eb913049387fb06a9795261b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3eca7ff9727f553a765a678e460803457526ff50a621bceaa7d4b24e14fc04d.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29366","characterName":"本城 銀","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29366"},"originalCharacterName":"本城 銀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"917"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"182"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Also known as Basil P, the producer behind internet idol Komeko (コメコ). He is an artist who is well-versed in music and also provides songs to other artists. He is an optimist with a generous spirit, but he can also be pushy and over confident. He has synesthesia that allows him to hear sounds through touch."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29366"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/53afab4bc6855f7fd6855243cb5dd66bdc1a38b49d67d1e8ca3b59baa16f007e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/49/499cff7ed1f7df7a12b18642bf6e780d1265b62b313e93c4828a46101b1a7673.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29367","characterName":"シオ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29367"},"originalCharacterName":"シオ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"20"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"308"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"He can use Si to control multiple thoughts at the same time. His emotions and consciousness are constantly dispersed, so even Sora cannot read his mind. His foul language is innate, and he's so indifferent to others that he'll instantly forget their names."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from in-game profile"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c29367"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/36/36524aff285c8e9d3b1ce3d5d9f4e3c4461439cf4fe635f758e9727a346dee95.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5fbaf10b0fdf9b3c86990f204831877b981a8492752f4b7c05c7ece7879d398.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29368","characterName":"月代 彩人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29368"},"originalCharacterName":"月代 彩人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"101"},"bloodType":{"r